[2.430914, "o", "EPLYX CI BUNDLE\r\n===============\r\n\r\nprogram:           SPoo1Ku8WFXoNDMHPsrGSTSG1Y47rzgn41SLUNakuHy\r\nadapter:           spl-stake-pool@3, cross-program invocation\r\nselection policy:  stratified-diversity v1\r\n\r\nbaseline sha256:   ec2dfefaa70d560754a0000f39bd2cabc192b895d36205b3c428f601b6e1d7e1\r\ncorpus sha256:     a4b667316b972685743bf0724b5596b7fbb64dde46468e159f44d773894f69b1\r\nbundle sha256:     5e5b67ac13e4f6b8249348ad81db29885ee8ee897ba78f6de213b55793f4285f\r\n\r\nrecords:           10 validated historical observations\r\nproduction window: slots 447850493 -> 447904974\r\n\r\nCOVERAGE\r\n  deposit            1 tested\r\n  withdraw           9 tested\r\n\r\nPINNED DEPENDENCIES\r\n  Stake11111111111111111111111111111111111111  3d2d39c596ce8be2  212056 bytes\r\n  TokenkegQfeZyiNwAJbNbGKPFXCWuBvf9Ss623VQ5DA  8190d3f7ceb6cb7a  108600 bytes\r\n\r\nKNOWN LIMITATIONS\r\n  - failed_original_transactions_unsupported\r\n    Transactions that failed on mainnet are observed but not replayed, so no failure path is represented.\r\n  - account_creation_paths_unsupported\r\n    Interactions that create a token account are outside the exact historical contract and are excluded.\r\n  - replay_runtime_rent_semantics_unsupported\r\n    Transactions crediting an account that stays below its rent-exempt minimum are accepted by mainnet and refused by the replay runtime, so they are excluded. Tip accounts are the common case.\r\n  - address_lookup_tables_unsupported\r\n    A v0 message that actually resolves addresses through a lookup table is outside the replay contract and is excluded, so any interaction shape that requires one is unrepresented.\r\n\r\nEvery hash verified against the bytes on disk.\r\n"]
